   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»﻿﻿﻿﻿threadCheck ❘ cc﻿﻿﻿﻿«",
   "text": "<p>专为螺纹刀具制造商设计的通用高端测量机</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a></p>",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/4/csm_threadCheckCC_header_98f44c09bf.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1080,
    "h": 930
